  "question": {
    "text": "In a solvent <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of an acid HA dimerizes and the rest dissociates. The van&#39;t Hoff factor of the acid is _____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;(Round off to the nearest integer)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "125",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let initial moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HA</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>HA</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HA</mi><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>&#160;final&#160;moles&#160;</mtext><mtext>&#160;initial&#160;moles&#160;</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
}